    text            : In-memory Support for Subscription Web Services - C O/M This feature provides in-memory processing for change, suspend, disconnect, and upgrade/downgrade web services. This processing creates a document (quote or order) from an existing asset. Self-service eCommerce applications will have the flexibility to perform multiple operations in the shopping cart or on a sales order before persisting the information in the database. The Web services have additional flags to enable pricing and eligibility/compatibility workflows as needed. • Web Services Guide Yes
    fields          :
      [0] In-memory Support for Subscription Web Services - C O/M
      [1] This feature provides in-memory processing for change, suspend, disconnect, and upgrade/downgrade web services. This processing creates a document (quote or order) from an existing asset. Self-service eCommerce applications will have the flexibility to perform multiple operations in the shopping cart or on a sales order before persisting the information in the database. The Web services have additional flags to enable pricing and eligibility/compatibility workflows as needed.
      [2] • Web Services Guide
      [3] Yes

