    text            : Imagine you have a bundle promotion subscription for two products (a magazine and a movie service) with a commitment (for a minimum subscription time). When you first sign up (base order), both products are active in your agreement. Now, let's say you want to change your subscription (modify order) and remove the magazine. This should make the magazine inactive in your agreement. So far, so good.

  [ITEM 23] 26_5_update_logical_block_2904
    page            : 169
    confidence      : 0.80
    pattern         : pattern_002
    role sequence   : PROMINENT
