    item evidence   :
      - structural_self_support: 0.70
      - boundary_isolation: 1.00
      - repetition_support: 1.00
      - content_density: 0.53
    text            : If you then suspend your entire subscription (suspend order) and later resume it (resume order), the magazine (which was previously set to inactive agreement line item) becomes active again. This is unexpected.

