    text            : Siebel CRM Known Issues document the most current information on known product anomalies and workarounds (where available) for the Siebel CRM 26.5 Monthly Update. The information contained in the current version of the this document supersedes the content of all documentation provided with or for Siebel CRM Applications. It is important that you thoroughly review the Known Issues prior to the installation and use of the software to ensure a smooth installation and update process. For the legal notice applicable to Siebel CRM Known Issues (Release Notes), review: Oracle Release Notes Legal Notice (Doc ID 547098.1) .

  [ITEM 2] 26_5_update_logical_block_2996
    page            : 172
    confidence      : 0.90
    pattern         : pattern_005
    role sequence   : PROMINENT
    source blocks   : 26_5_update_block_3036
    item evidence   :
      - structural_self_support: 0.70
      - boundary_isolation: 1.00
      - repetition_support: 1.00
      - content_density: 1.00
    text            : In some cases, Oracle’s Siebel CRM products and features are not available in the release or are not available with certain databases, Siebel Enterprise Server operating systems, or Siebel CRM international localizations. Many of these limitations are due to third-party product support limitations. Product and feature availability exceptions are not documented in the Known Issues database. System Requirements and Platform Certifications are available from the Certifications tab on My Oracle Support. For more information on certifications, see: Using Certifications on My Oracle Support for Siebel CRM Products (Doc ID 1492194.1) .

