    text            : Internally Created Caches Visible in the Siebel Management Console May Be Ignored Category Installation & Deployment Subcategory Enterprise Cache Bug No <mark>38498327</mark> In the Siebel Management Console (SMC) under the Enterprise Cache section on the Siebel Server machine to which you have deployed your Enterprise Cache Client Profile, you may see more cache names than you have deployed. The default name of the cache that the Siebel Application uses is “siebelcache”, though you may have named your cache differently. All other cache names are internal to the Coherence application and do not interact with the Siebel application. They should be ignored. In a future update we will filter these from the Enterprise Cache Applet.

