    text            : Category Integration Subcategory Other Bug No 35577179 Siebel CRM 23.8 marks the upgrade of OCI SDK JAR from 2.31.x to 3.2.2, which enables customers to utilize custom model training. While the new OCI SDK JAR requires a higher JAVA Heap size, the OCI SDK JARs 3.2.2 in Siebel’s internal Tomcat has been moved from Siebel WAR and placed as a zip file in Siebel’s internal Tomcat itself. This means that customers who do not uptake this JAR need not have an initial higher JAVA Heap for the internal Tomcat. Customers who want to uptake AI/ML powered features need to unzip the file and copy the JARs to Siebel folder inside the internal Tomcat. Customers who want to uptake AI/ML powered features need to unzip the file and copy the JARs to Siebel folder inside the internal Tomcat.

